==Notes==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* Given the choice between this feat and [[great constitution]], the latter is usually the better choice. Taking ''epic toughness'' twice grants 40 hit points (regardless of level), while taking ''great constitution'' twice grants (indirectly) a +1 bonus to [[fortitude]] [[saving throw]]s and [[concentration]], in addition to (at level 40) granting 40 hit points.
** A notable exception is that this feat is usually the better choice for characters who typically [[polymorph]] into forms that override [[constitution]].